WEBVTT

00:00:00.259 --> 00:00:01.800
Let's break down the primary components.

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.700
Okay. The absolute foundation is an

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:06.700
entity type. So an entity type

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:09.360
is the broad conceptual category.

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:11.159
In the retail scenario from the

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.440
source, store would be an entity

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:14.799
type or product.

00:00:15.079 --> 00:00:16.580
Correct. It is the template.

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:18.060
Then you have an instance.

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:20.560
An instance is one specific physical

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:23.140
real -world manifestation of that entity

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:26.880
type. So store number 402, located

00:00:26.759 --> 00:00:29.060
in downtown Seattle, is an instance

00:00:28.939 --> 00:00:30.220
of the store entity.
